  "display_title": "I Have A Boyfriend",
  "description": "\"A romantic campus love story about a gay soccer star and his regained first love!\" \n\nThe campus soccer star Hyunho runs into his first love Gyul at the university. Back then in middle school, Gyul saw Hyunho as a friend and never learned about his feelings. Hyunho, still in love with the withdrawn Gyul, lends him a helping hand. Because Gyul's aunt is taking advantage of him, Gyul has to support his younger brother. To thank Hyunho, Gyul helps him navigate university assignments. What starts out as a caring friendship, soon flourishes into a romantic relationship. But then, Hyunho receives an offer to play abroad in the major league. Will Hyunho and Gyul be able to overcome this hardship, too? \n\n(Source: Netcomics)",
